      <p class="tho-crew__lead">Every job is a fixed price agreed before we start. No hourly meter, no surprises.</p>
      <p class="tho-crew__swipe" aria-hidden="true">Swipe to compare all three &rarr;</p>
      <div class="tho-crew__grid">
        <article class="tho-card tho-card--pro">
          <span class="tho-card__badge">Most popular</span>
